# This GitHub repo only publishes the Deadlock Tools project folders.
# Ignore everything else in this workspace (game files, research, secrets).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/deadlock-game-tools-image.jpg
!/screenshots/
!/screenshots/**
!/Deadlock Tools - */
!/Deadlock Tools - */**
!/DEPRECATED - Deadlock Tools - */
!/DEPRECATED - Deadlock Tools - */**

# Game data and generated output (even inside tool folders)
*.exe
!**/dist/*.exe
*.sav
*.dll
*.DAT
*.gif
*.map.txt
*.bak
.env
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/build/*
!**/build/.gitkeep
**/dist/*
!**/dist/.gitkeep
!**/dist/*.exe
extracted_deadlock_sprites/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
